⚡️🇮🇹Clashes in Bologna in front of the station during a protest against the high cost of living. 

Groups of hooded young people threw stones, bottles, and barriers at the police, who responded with water cannons and tear gas. Dozens of rental bicycles were overturned, and at least seven people were detained.

