⚡️🇮🇹Violent clashes in Milan, in Piazza Duomo and Piazza dei Mercanti, where groups of hooded protesters threw stones, bottles, and other objects at the police.

Officers responded with tear gas, charges, and water cannons, dispersing the crowd and clearing the square in front of the cathedral. Several people, including some police officers, were injured and treated by ambulances.

